%% Next-Term Allocation lifecycle (ASG): asg_allocation with source RENEWAL and renewal AWAITING_EXTENSION/CONTINUING
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> AwaitingExtension : window opens at M2, last Term of the Stay (job, FR-ASG-07)
  [*] --> Continuing : window opens at M2, Terms left in the Stay (job, FR-ASG-07)
  AwaitingExtension --> Continuing : extension approved (FR-REQ-04)
  AwaitingExtension --> Cancelled : not extended by M3 (job, FR-ASG-07)
  Continuing --> Continuing : room change or swap approved, Bed moves (FR-REQ-01, FR-REQ-02)
  Continuing --> Cancelled : end of stay approved (FR-REQ-04) or not enrolled (FR-AUTH-08)
  Continuing --> Cancelled : next-Term fee unpaid at M7 (job, FR-ASG-08)
  Continuing --> Resident : fee paid and the new Term starts (FR-ASG-08)
  Resident --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]

  AwaitingExtension : Awaiting extension (ACTIVE)
  Continuing : Continuing (ACTIVE)
  Resident : Resident in the new Term
